---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import business from '../data/business.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Ocean Prime Pool Service | Naples, FL"
  description="Ocean Prime Pool Service is Southwest Florida's dependable partner for weekly pool care, equipment repair, and detailed digital reporting."
  path="/about/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About', href: '' }]} />

  <section class="section container">
    <h1>About Ocean Prime Pool Service</h1>
    <p style="max-width: 65ch;">Ocean Prime Pool Service helps homeowners throughout Naples, Bonita Springs, Estero, and Marco Island enjoy a clean, balanced, worry-free pool through reliable weekly service, professional equipment care, and transparent communication.</p>
    <div class="image-placeholder">Real photo placeholder &mdash; Ocean Prime team</div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint container">
    <h2>Our Approach</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 65ch;">We built Ocean Prime around a simple idea: homeowners shouldn't have to wonder whether their pool was actually serviced. That's why every visit ends with a detailed digital report &mdash; water chemistry readings, completed tasks, and technician notes &mdash; so you always know exactly what was done.</p>
    <p style="max-width: 65ch;">We also believe pool care shouldn't require juggling multiple companies. Ocean Prime handles weekly cleaning, maintenance, equipment repair, and renovation, all from one team that knows your pool's history.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
    <ul style="color: var(--color-ink-secondary); font-size: var(--fs-small); line-height: 2;">
      <li>Detailed digital service reports after every visit</li>
      <li>Consistent weekly technician, not a rotating roster</li>
      <li>If we ever miss a visit, you get a $20 credit</li>
      <li>Cleaning and equipment repair from one company</li>
      <li>Experience with major pool equipment brands</li>
      <li>Local knowledge of Southwest Florida pools and climate</li>
      <li>Service options for full-time and seasonal homeowners</li>
      <li>{business.insuranceStatement}</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint container" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
    <a href="/#quote-form" class="btn btn--primary">Request Your Free Pool Evaluation</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .image-placeholder {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    height: 220px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--color-prime-blue-tint);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-prime-blue-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-prime-blue);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    padding: 0 var(--space-md);
  }
</style>
